    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian tears roll down cheeks",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你从来不听我说话",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Sadness",
    "source_text": "一对年轻情侣在吧台前吵起来了。\n女孩哭着说\"你从来不听我说话\"，男孩说\"你每次都这样\"。苏念站在吧台后面，不知道该不该插嘴。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian finishes preparing and carries the cup over",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "男孩点了两杯拿铁，摔了钱包在桌上。\n苏念做好端过去。女孩低着头，不喝。\n男孩喝了一口，站起来去洗手间。\n苏念看着那杯还在冒热气的拿铁——女孩的那杯。"
  },
